      "bookmarkId": "40405120_63_657-820",
      "chapterUid": 63,
      "range": "657-820",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "工作的本质是交易，我们在用自己的时间和才能，通过一家公司，与市场交换金钱。",
      "totalCount": 11040
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 36205435,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_68_1912-1968",
      "chapterUid": 68,
      "range": "1912-1968",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我们必须习惯用发展的眼光看问题，人生不是几把牌，赢了就赢了，人生是个牌局，想散都散不了的那种，输赢不在一把两把。",
      "totalCount": 10880
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 11407322,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_80_2786-2811",
      "chapterUid": 80,
      "range": "2786-2811",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "问事实，别问想法；问行为，别问理由；问事，别问人。",
      "totalCount": 8965
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 300466840,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_66_1364-1400",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "1364-1400",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "无论如何，先行动起来，写起来，写不好你还写不坏吗？有了坏的，才能有好的。",
      "totalCount": 8245
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 300466840,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_72_1419-1448",
      "chapterUid": 72,
      "range": "1419-1448",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "面对一个大脑，想要影响它，最好是从情绪进入，再去说服理性。",
      "totalCount": 7514
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 38660210,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_66_1837-1845",
      "chapterUid": 66,
      "range": "1837-1845",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "完成比完美重要。",
      "totalCount": 7434
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 247265063,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_71_3414-3493",
      "chapterUid": 71,
      "range": "3414-3493",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "每天睡觉前要考察的只有一件事：你有没有持续地变好？今天是否获得了一点昨天没有的东西？这是查理·芒格的建议，事实上我看很多优秀的人在读到这个建议前就是这么做的。",
      "totalCount": 6919
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 13874681,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_64_2590-2608",
      "chapterUid": 64,
      "range": "2590-2608",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "别离开战场，别离开战友，别离开敌人。",
      "totalCount": 6144
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 375659460,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_64_1829-1867",
      "chapterUid": 64,
      "range": "1829-1867",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "越早丧失看剧的乐趣，越早发现观察剧的乐趣，越早成为一个合格的以创作为生的人。",
      "totalCount": 5616
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 296577893,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_74_1887-1956",
      "chapterUid": 74,
      "range": "1887-1956",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "做一个真诚的人，尽可能善良，不掩藏痛苦，也不羞涩于快乐，放心地把自己交给舞台，交给同伴，交给世界，那怎么找都找不到的风格，也许就会来找你。",
      "totalCount": 5370
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 375659460,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_64_2976-3001",
      "chapterUid": 64,
      "range": "2976-3001",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "以大多数人的懒惰程度，真的谈不到被创作掏空的地步。",
      "totalCount": 5292
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 296577893,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_78_3832-3892",
      "chapterUid": 78,
      "range": "3832-3892",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不是不可以否定别人，而是请用清晰的意见，更好的创意来否定。而不是只说一个，“我觉得不行”；或者更糟糕的，“你别说话了”。",
      "totalCount": 5185
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 365959882,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_69_1243-1308",
      "chapterUid": 69,
      "range": "1243-1308",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "脱口秀演员（其实演员也是，只是演员暴露得晚一点），拼到最后也是拼人格，抛开一切技巧文本，最终你吸引观众的，就是你藏都藏不住的人格。",
      "totalCount": 4860
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 224481196,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_71_3086-3143",
      "chapterUid": 71,
      "range": "3086-3143",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "不是你去找观众，而要让观众来找你。狠狠地操练自己，你越强，找到你的观众越多。而不是你能讨好的人越多，你的观众越多。",
      "totalCount": 4352
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 523204925,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_64_1457-1485",
      "chapterUid": 64,
      "range": "1457-1485",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "要意识到你的全部人生都理应为你的创作提供养分，为它服务。",
      "totalCount": 4199
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 323509801,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_64_1200-1238",
      "chapterUid": 64,
      "range": "1200-1238",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "创作是一份调动你一切人生的工作。一份即便调动了一切，也常常创作不出来的工作。",
      "totalCount": 4114
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 905985366,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_71_3590-3617",
      "chapterUid": 71,
      "range": "3590-3617",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "心灵鸡汤很多都是对的，它是鸡汤的原因是很少有人去实践。",
      "totalCount": 4016
    },
    {
      "bookId": "40405120",
      "userVid": 296577893,
      "bookmarkId": "40405120_72_3179-3206",
      "chapterUid": 72,
      "range": "3179-3206",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你的弱点就是人类的弱点，你那份情绪，是人类共有的情绪。",
      "totalCount": 3648
    },
    {
